Prices is: coffee beans $12.50, mug $8, filter papers $3.20.
Total is 0.
Ask user for item.
If user write "done", stop asking.
If item not in prices, say "This item is not in list" and ask again.
Ask how many.
Add price multiply how many to total.
Repeat ask item until done.
Show total.
If total more than $50, take off 10% and show discount total.
